# Design library & QA corpus — kept locally, not tracked in the repo.
# Anchored to the repo root: an unanchored entry also matches nested directories — an
# unanchored `docs/` once silently swallowed new fixtures under `src/test/fixtures/docs/`
# (already-tracked files were unaffected, so the breakage only showed up on a fresh clone).
/import-statement-design/
/qa/
/qa-roadmap/
